  "content": "{section: Intro}\n[D5] [F#] [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7] (x2)\n\n{section: Verso 1}\n[D5]I have not been home since you [F#]left long ago [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I'm thumbing my way back to [F#]heaven [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]Counting steps, walking backwards [F#]on the road [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I'm counting my way back to [F#]heaven [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n\n{section: Refrão 1}\n[G/B]I can't be free with what's locked inside of [C]me\n[Am]If there was a key, you took it in your [G]hand\n[G/B]There's no wrong or right, but I'm sure there's good and [C]bad\n[Am]The questions linger [G/B]overhead\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[D5]No matter how cold the winter, there's a [F#]springtime ahead [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I'm thumbing my way back to [F#]heaven [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I wish that I could hold you [F#] [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I wish that I [F#]had [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\nThinking 'bout heaven\n\n{section: Ponte}\n[Dm]I let go of a rope, thinking that's what held me [F]back\n[C]And in time I've realized, it's now wrapped [Em]around my neck\n[A#]\n[F]\n[Dm]I can't see what's next, from this lonely [F]overpass\n[C]Hang my head and count my steps, as another [Em]car goes past\n[A#]\n[F]\n\n{section: Refrão 2}\n[G/B]All the rusted signs we ignore throughout [Bm]our lives [C]\n[Am]Choosing the shiny ones [G]instead\n[G/B]I turned my back, now there's no turning [Bm]back [C] [Am] [G/B]\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[D5]No matter how cold the winter, there's a [F#]springtime ahead [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I smile, but who am I [F#]kidding? [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I'm just walking the mile, every once in a while I'll get a [F#]ride [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n[D5]I'm thumbing my way back to [F#]heaven [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7]\n\n{section: Outro}\n[D5]Thumbing my way back to heaven [F#] [G/B] [A7sus4] [A7] (x2)\n[D5]"
